.stackholders.v2.justify-content-between{ class: local_assigns[:wrapper_class] }
  .funded-by.text-center
    .font-weight-normal.text-center.text-funded.mb-2
      សហការគាំទ្រមូលនិធិដោយ / Co-funded by:
    .d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center.mr-lg-5
      = link_to 'https://eeas.europa.eu/delegations/cambodia_en', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer', class: 'mr-2' do
        = image_tag 'stakeholder_v2/eu.png', class: 'img-funded', alt: 'EU Cambodia'

      = link_to 'https://www.entwicklung.at/en/ada', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' do
        = image_tag 'stakeholder_v2/ipa.png', class: 'img-funded austrian-logo', alt: 'International Partnerships Austria'

  .implemented-by.pt-3.mt-md-0
    .font-weight-normal.text-center.text-implemented
      សហការអនុវត្តដោយ / Co-implemented by:
    .d-flex.align-items-center.justify-content-center.flex-wrap.img-implemented-wrapper
      = link_to 'https://www.care-cambodia.org/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' do
        = image_tag 'stakeholder_v2/care.png', class: 'img-implemented img-fluid', alt: 'CARE Cambodia'

      = link_to 'https://ycc.org.kh', class: "my-3 my-md-0", target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' do
        = image_tag 'stakeholder_v2/ycc.png', class: 'img-implemented img-fluid ycc-logo', alt: 'Youth Council of Cambodia'

      = link_to 'https://www.ideacambodia.org', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer' do
        = image_tag 'stakeholder_v2/idea.jpg', class: 'img-implemented img-fluid', alt: 'IDEA Cambodia'
